        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions Custom Black Walnut Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis is a pair of back to back mounted pulls. Each pull is made from 1-1/2 inch diameter Black Walnut. The pulls are 36 inches overall with 24 inch center to centers. The Back to Back 36 Inch Black Walnut Wood Door Pull Set has an custom design that features an 18 inch long centered grip that is 1/8 inches smaller in diameter.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Packaged with 2 pulls</b>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions CLB01 Wood Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Solid Black Walnut</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\nPull Bracket Finish: Polished Stainless Steel\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3.19\"</li>\r\n<li>Sold as a Pair (2 Door Pulls) with Back-to-Back mounting</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Custom Order. <b>No Returns</b></i>\r\n</p>",
